      "body": "## Summary\n\nFixes part of #28808. `TRTLLMHAAttnBackend` inherits from `FlashInferAttnBackend`\nbut reuses very little from the parent. This PR removes two redundant attribute\nassignments that the parent already sets to identical values.\n\n## Changes\n\nRemoved these lines from `TRTLLMHAAttnBackend.__init__()`:\n```python\nself.max_context_len = model_runner.model_config.context_len\nself.page_size = model_runner.page_size\n```\n\nBoth are already set by `FlashInferAttnBackend.__init__()` with the same source\nexpressions after `super().__init__()` returns. This was purely redundant.\n\n## Validation\n\n- [x] Syntax check passes\n- [ ] Full test suite (CI will handle)\n\n## Next steps\n\nThis is a small, safe cleanup. The broader refactor suggested in #28808\n(making TRTLLM inherit directly from `AttentionBackend` instead of\n`FlashInferAttnBackend`) is a larger change that would require skipping\nFlashInfer wrapper and indices-updater allocations that TRTLLM never uses.\n\n---\n\n**AI Disclosure:** This PR was authored with AI assistance. The human author is responsible for all changes.\n\nSigned-off-by: yancy <yancy@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #38437658917](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38437658917)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #38437658884](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38437658884)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #38437658900](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/38437658900)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
